# Rollout videos are never committed.
#
# Two reasons, both hard blockers:
#   1. Anonymity. The source .MOV files carry com.apple.quicktime.location.ISO6709
#      (GPS), make/model and capture timestamps. Git history is permanent and public
#      once pushed, so a single commit would de-anonymise the submission forever.
#   2. Size. The raw clips are ~291 MB; GitHub warns past 50 MB per file, hard-blocks
#      at 100 MB, and Pages sites are capped at 1 GB.
#
# Publish the transcoded, metadata-stripped .mp4 files by another route (a release
# asset, an object store, or git-lfs on a separate repo) and drop them into
# assets/videos/ at deploy time. See assets/videos/README.md for the filenames.
assets/videos/*
!assets/videos/.gitkeep
!assets/videos/README.md

# Local scratch
_*.html
*.synctex.gz

# OS cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
